body: "Follow-up to #153. CodeRabbit's review of 41d8d58 left two non-blocking findings:\n\n- [evaluation-plan.ts:198](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/153#discussion_r4546507762): Apply the 200-byte write limit to generated Plan and look IDs.\n- [test/fixtures/replay-order.ts:13](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/153#discussion_r4546507769): Normalize replay digest paths to forward slashes before hashing.\n\nEach fix needs a test that fails on revert."
